"risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c678a633739ce7bf0fc5a46512381f291ce3d28460025e87d944e6d83ed02250", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nWhatever you think is actually going on in this example, it certainly\nshows that some care has to be exercised when defining irreducible\ncomponents, connectedness, etc of algebraic spaces.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d4bbb029d3a2a361c829cab8d4fe137ff8bd9b02fbeb39cd9b1090b61b34fbdf", "unit_id": "inventory:spaces:02Z0:paragraph/0010"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:spaces:inventory:spaces:03FO:paragraph/0001", "hash": "sha256:88746a5eaac70b57affd374f6659e0fc51f6241a09a3c2705d221474751e1a03", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 94070, "byte_start": 93744, "file": "spaces.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:9f3d2e5da151ffc44f8ff84c2f5029a3575520a6d0ed181949382e3afe7ce07b", "line_end": 2555, "line_start": 2550}, "owner_tag": "03FO", "parent_tag": "03FO", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03FO", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R1", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:4786739b94903ba19c58e757d903d6c99d490ad8a152ca7a43edb5e0df7aff66", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we briefly discuss what happens when we change big sites.\nThe upshot is that we can always enlarge the big site at will, hence we\nmay assume any set of schemes we want to consider is contained in the big\nfppf site over which we consider our algebraic space. Here is a precise\nstatement of the result.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d345bf993b10e3663ced7438648d60abd1f8c9fffa329a1afb8f8ccee292964d", "unit_id": "inventory:spaces:03FO:paragraph/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:spaces:inventory:spaces:03FP:lemma/0001", "hash": "sha256:b7de8ac745f2a70eb4d78269bd61851706107fe7bd495a25c872c2ec35447caa", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 94997, "byte_start": 94072, "file": "spaces.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:887a79d810e2b71855d8b69ccfd800e3435913fc2ab471b33761cedaac1698ea", "line_end": 2582, "line_start": 2557}, "owner_tag": "03FP", "parent_tag": "03FO", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "03FO", "placeholders": {"LOCKED_0001": "\\label{lemma-change-big-site}", "MATH_0001": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch'_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$\\Sch'_{fppf}$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0007": "\\begin{align*}\ng : \\Sh((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\Sh((\\Sch'/S)_{fppf}), \\\\\nf : \\Sh((\\Sch'/S)_{fppf})\n\\longrightarrow\n\\Sh((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})\n\\end{align*}", "MATH_0008": "$F$", "MATH_0009": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0010": "$F$", "MATH_0011": "$X \\in \\Ob((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})$", "MATH_0012": "$S$", "MATH_0013": "$f^{-1}F$", "MATH_0014": "$X$", "MATH_0015": "$(\\Sch'/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0016": "$F$", "MATH_0017": "$S$", "MATH_0018": "$f^{-1}F$", "MATH_0019": "$S$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{topologies-section-change-alpha}", "REF_0002": "\\ref{topologies-lemma-change-alpha}", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{lemma}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0006": "\\end{lemma}"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:133c01a0002a36fe8a6ec654648c109d6c45ee2382de9641dd7fc902e204b400", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:513557e7280e0fbd8bd1286998cc48c168722f09d312aeccc74a0881a16abfd6", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001>\n<LOCKED_0001>\nSuppose given big sites <MATH_0001> and <MATH_0002>.\nAssume that <MATH_0003> is contained in <MATH_0004>,\nsee Topologies, Section <REF_0001>.\nLet <MATH_0005> be an object of <MATH_0006>. Let\n<MATH_0007>\nbe the morphisms of topoi of\nTopologies, Lemma <REF_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0008> be a sheaf of sets on <MATH_0009>. Then\n<STRUCT_0002>\n<STRUCT_0003> if <MATH_0010> is representable by a scheme\n<MATH_0011> over <MATH_0012>,\nthen <MATH_0013> is representable too, in fact it is representable by the\nsame scheme <MATH_0014>, now viewed as an object of <MATH_0015>, and\n<STRUCT_0004> if <MATH_0016> is an algebraic space over <MATH_0017>, then <MATH_0018> is an algebraic\nspace over <MATH_0019> also.\n<STRUCT_0005>\n<STRUCT_0006>", "source_text_hash": "sha256:56832de52ef08641c45825cfb9f027bf49b0cc6f4e647cd522a1dc1814a05112", "unit_id": "inventory:spaces:03FP:lemma/0001"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:spaces:inventory:spaces:03FP:proof/0001", "hash": "sha256:514d254d5744063470a408b781dc1053d8fac6824afdd41bdbea7b1d9ea9a7c7", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 95752, "byte_start": 94999, "file": "spaces.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:d08e309c68c0ba3a924b5b8752bd954c3c8252fe70167ab39967ac93d611e2a1", "line_end": 2599, "line_start": 2584}, "owner_tag": "03FP", "parent_tag": "03FO", "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_unit": {"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "03FO", "placeholders": {"ACCENT_0001": "\\'e", "MATH_0001": "$X \\in \\Ob((\\Sch/S)_{fppf})$", "MATH_0002": "$h_X$", "MATH_0003": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0004": "$X$", "MATH_0005": "$h'_X$", "MATH_0006": "$(\\Sch'/S)_{fppf}$", "MATH_0007": "