39965a70173f", "stage": "STRUCTURE_OK", "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "cardinality", "target_term": "基数"}, {"source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}], "term_status": "DECISION_REQUIRED", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n注意，这个引理纯粹是集合（set）论的，几乎没有内容。此外，大景（site）上的代数空间（algebraic space）限制到小景（site）上后是代数空间（algebraic space），这一点（一般而言）并不成立（仅仅是基数（cardinality）方面的原因）。因此，我们只能用这种简单的引理来扩大基范畴（category），而不能缩小它。\n\n", "translation_hash": "sha256:06bbfd84b2bdb15b7c650e27e7b22e688699aa472c11a1c675e8ec87765d4bdb", "unit_id": "tag:03FO:prose-0002", "unknown_terms": [{"context": "引理属于集合论。", "source_term": "set", "target_term": "集合"}, {"context": "比较大小两个景。", "source_term": "site", "target_term": "景"}, {"context": "代数空间向较小景的限制。", "source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"context": "限制后未必为代数空间的基数原因。", "source_term": "cardinality", "target_term": "基数"}, {"context": "代数空间所依据的基范畴。", "source_term": "category", "target_term": "范畴"}]}
